      "role": "user",
      "content": "That’s good to hear, but I’m looking at a preliminary data dump from the Chicago site that seems to contradict your summary. There's a cluster of patient intake notes from the last 24 hours mentioning severe dizziness and vertigo.\n\nIf your telemetry is reporting zero emerging signals, why aren't these specific reports showing up in your summary? Is there a lag in how these symptoms are being processed, or is there a discrepancy between the site's manual logs and your automated feed?",
